cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "agentic-bpm-2026: A benchmark for LLM-mediated BPM execution steps"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark harness that measures how reliably current reasoning LLMs
  perform well-defined tasks that an agentic process engine would delegate
  to a model at runtime (transition-condition evaluation, data mapping, ...)
  when the relevant business data is kept external to the model and supplied
  per call as a semantic data pool.
